er Updates\n\nJava Server ensures that all SAP's operations are Java-based and aligned with the company's strategic goals. Their focus on improving Java server capabilities, noted starting 2025, is crucial in maintaining SAP's operational stability and innovation, especially in managing complex Java server integrations and software updates. Their efforts underscore the commitment to upholding high Java server standards and innovative practices. [Data: Sources (12, 13), Date_Range ((2025, 09, 04), (2025, 09, 04))]"], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small"}}, "key": "embeddings_1de3030273d0bd60f0ba26038fd23997c38e67e591311eb1abe7aa5daad9733d_v2"}